<title>UK: WestLB adds 250 mln marks to Dec 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>WestLB adds 250 mln marks to Dec 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 2.75 billion marks from 2.5 billion marks, joint lead managers Bankgesellschaft Berling, Landesbank Hessen Thuringen, Norddeutsche Landesbank and Westdeutsche Landesbank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT  * 250 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    12.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  96.47     PAY DATE    14.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.30	REOFFER    =	   LISTING     DUES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    8 BP	SELL CONC  22 BP     DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING 2.5 BLN MARK ISSUE</p>
<p>		PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANBRIEF 7502</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
